{"id": "29421e01ceed7bd3d2016b2bc8752536", "text": "Bheeshma Parva, Chapter 13] . The stunned Dhrutarashtra wants to know \neverything that happened on the battlefield from the very beginning. \nSanjaya narrates all the events from the beginning of the war. He stays with \nthe king till the end of the war relaying all the events to him. He can do this \nbecause Sage Vedavyasa grants him divine vision to remotely view the war \nand provide him with  updates.  \nAll 47 verses in the first chapter and the first 10 verses in the second", "embedding": [-0.012643392197787762, 0.036862559616565704, -0.025980990380048752, -0.0348980650305748, -0.013148821890354156, 0.10697900503873825, -0.012646117247641087, 0.04728951305150986, 0.01889846660196781, -0.006421040743589401, -0.0025008958764374256, -0.020114192739129066, -0.052719827741384506, -0.06217977777123451, -0.04291312396526337, 0.013995470479130745, 0.007934728637337685, -0.02460610494017601, -0.005227360874414444, -0.04572649672627449, 0.027785465121269226, 0.0517275296151638, 0.02372560277581215, -0.010253782384097576, 0.04844927042722702, 0.10909610241651535, -0.004602663218975067, -0.014614583924412727, -0.008992855437099934, -0.037407245486974716, 0.07367337495088577, -0.08475439250469208, 0.009503303095698357, 0.027604782953858376, 0.012834493070840836, 0.024440743029117584, -0.027301112189888954, 0.1034335047006607, 0.07388193160295486, -0.0143485888838768, 0.0145864337682724, 0.035011280328035355, -0.06269261986017227, 0.06100582703948021, 0.03749086707830429, 0.05702840909361839, 0.0022887480445206165, -0.002259604400023818, 0.039233606308698654, 0.03423473611474037, -0.06894870102405548, -0.009671716019511223, -0.0227008368819952, 0.05006270483136177, 0.08310645073652267, -0.05676111578941345, 0.010270124301314354, -0.004574544262140989, 0.05379879102110863, 0.023249447345733643, -0.05485059693455696, 0.034662876278162, 0.00969815906137228, -0.016509737819433212, 0.0008732888381928205, -0.09704063832759857, 